    note: "10 Big Poes haunt fixed spots in Hyrule Field once Link is an adult, and each spot gives up only 1. Ride over a spot on Epona and a Big Poe appears; on foot you may get an ordinary Poe instead. Big Poes cannot be targeted. Shoot one twice with the Fairy Bow, then catch its soul in an empty Bottle before it fades, and sell it to the Poe Collector at the ruined Market entrance. Each Bottle carries 1 soul.",
